---
# OpSy's checks, less one:
#
# - readability-identifier-length: the fits here write their formulas in the
#   notation of the literature they come from (x, y, z of a sample, m of a
#   matrix, v of an eigenvector); longer names would make the code harder to
#   hold against its source.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-identifier-length
...
